.secrets/** filter=git-crypt diff=git-crypt
# Context-bearing unified diffs (upstream patch files) reproduce the
# upstream sources' own indentation verbatim in their hunk/context lines,
# which trips git's space-before-tab / trailing-whitespace checks on every
# `git diff --check` gate. Disable whitespace checking for *.patch only —
# normal source/docs keep the full check.
*.patch -whitespace
